From 3c5724e7690d735211da566d28ed3c1ba7682c7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:44:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs(process): a cut list and a cut line replace the P1/P2
 start condition

A cut no longer waits until all P1 and P2 issues are closed. The maintainer
names what the cut includes (the cut list). After that the list is closed
(the cut line): no agent adds an item, and each open P1 or P2 outside the
list goes under "Known issues" and ships in the next minor.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
